# Staged Quickshell module manifest for editor/LSP tooling only.
#
# This file is intentionally NOT named `qmldir`, because Quickshell
# resolves `pragma Singleton` types from the config directory without
# one, and adding a real `qmldir` risks changing (or breaking) that
# runtime registration. To use it for qmllint/qmlls, rename to `qmldir`
# in ~/.config/quickshell (or this directory) and restart your editor:
#     cp qmldir.lsp ~/.config/quickshell/qmldir
# Revert by deleting that copy.
#
# NOTE: Colors.qml is generated by Nix (Hjem) and only exists in the live
# ~/.config/quickshell directory, so this listing assumes it is present.

singleton Colors 1.0 Colors.qml
singleton Config 1.0 Config.qml
singleton MediaService 1.0 MediaService.qml
singleton NotificationStore 1.0 NotificationStore.qml
singleton WindowFocuser 1.0 WindowFocuser.qml

BatteryWidget 1.0 BatteryWidget.qml
BluetoothWidget 1.0 BluetoothWidget.qml
